description: How to write compatibility notes in this repo
globs: docs/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

# Docs

- Label each compatibility claim `observed`, `inferred`, or `open`.
- Cite the command or file that supports an observed claim. Do not paste a full journal.
- For each gap, name the home: an existing upstream, Fedora packaging, a config note, or this repo. One sentence on why.
- Leave serial numbers, UUIDs, MAC addresses, SSIDs, passwords, and LAN hostnames out of the page.
- Model board-ids and PCI ids may stay. They identify the product, not one laptop.
- Do not copy proprietary DSP graphs or firmware into `docs/`.
